model rb
  tally 2
  on 2026-03-10
  start 2026-01-01
  end 2026-12-31

source card "invented"
unit PLN: currency minor 0.01
place konto: accounts PLN lives 2026-01-01..
place sav: accounts PLN lives 2026-01-01..

ask q5: bal(sav, 2026-02-28) with opening[sav] = 7 PLN

version v
